RA.png\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/E48HVr9VgAQABRA.png","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1624851079,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/gov_online/status/1409353693695152139","original_url":"https://twitter.com/gov_online/status/1409353693695152139"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oMw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08970979-5058-4dc8-a884-34d67c41e270","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"これか、めっちゃありがたい。あやうく26日なりそうだった。","ts":"1626844561.448500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UeEk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2964b42-e1be-4d50-b043-07937c8a41e4","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"\u003chttp://www.kantei.go.jp/jp/headline/tokyo2020/shukujitsu.html\u003e","ts":"1626844524.447600","attachments":[{"fallback":"首相官邸ホームページ: 2021年の祝日移動について | 首相官邸ホームページ","id":1,"title":"2021年の祝日移動について | 首相官邸ホームページ","title_link":"http://www.kantei.go.jp/jp/headline/tokyo2020/shukujitsu.html","text":"2021年の「海の日」は7月22日、「スポーツの日」は7月23日、「山の日」を8月8日に移動します。","image_url":"https://www.kantei.go.jp/jp/content/shukujitsu_image01.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"首相官邸ホームページ","service_icon":"http://www.kantei.go.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"http://www.kantei.go.jp/jp/headline/tokyo2020/shukujitsu.html","original_url":"http://www.kantei.go.jp/jp/headline/tokyo2020/shukujitsu.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ChGD9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"90332701-fbef-457d-a1ce-cab011338e91","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"振込業務おわった。税金納付、どうしようかな…","ts":"1626837185.447200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K+VpR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e396147f-4c9a-4961-9818-36ee6158af